BEGIN:VEVENT
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://map-india.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-07-20-185128.png
CATEGORIES:Drop-in Sessions,MAP,CBD
DTSTAMP:20260720T132234Z
DESCRIPTION:You may have read a comic. Or even tried drawing them. Do you want to create one?  Join this edition of Make at MAP to create a character with papers from scratch.\n\nThis programme is part of the celebration of the opening of A Moving Line: 1500 Years of Indian Visual Storytelling. \n\nMake @ MAP is a series that allows you to explore our collection in an engaging and hands-on manner. These sessions allow you to create and take home a special souvenir of your visit. It is perfect for all ages — so bring your friends and family and get ready to make some art! No experience is necessary\, just a willingness to have fun and experiment with new materials.
DTEND:20260726T093000Z
DTSTART:20260726T053000Z
SUMMARY:Make at MAP: Comical Collage
UID:1354@map-india.org
URL:https://map-india.org/map-events/make-at-map-comical-collage/
END:VEVENT
