BEGIN:VEVENT
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://map-india.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ChampacaBookstore_VasanthNagar_020625-4-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Drop-in Sessions,MAP,CBD
DTSTAMP:20260723T082335Z
DESCRIPTION:Image credits: Abheet Anand (2025)\nComics may have been a huge part of your childhood or you might be thinking of giving it a shot. Be it a voracious reader to a beginner looking for comics to read\, there is something for everyone this weekend. Champaca Bookstore is hosting a special pop-up stall featuring a curated selection of comics. This is a chance to find your next read here and perhaps\, get it autographed by those who created it. This two-day-long pop-up becomes a perfect spot to meet fellow readers.\n\nThis session is in collaboration with Champaca Bookstore.\n\nThis programme is part of the celebration of the opening of A Moving Line: 1500 Years of Indian Visual Storytelling. 
DTEND:20260726T140000Z
DTSTART:20260725T043000Z
SUMMARY:For the Reading S(h)elf!
